CRPIX2  = '' / Pixel coordinate of reference point                              PC1_1   = '' / Coordinate transformation matrix element                         PC1_2   = '' / Coordinate transformation matrix element                         PC2_1   = '' / Coordinate transformation matrix element                         PC2_2   = '' / Coordinate transformation matrix element                         CDELT1  = '' / [deg] Coordinate increment at reference point                    CDELT2  = '' / [deg] Coordinate increment at reference point                    CUNIT1  = 'deg     '           / Units of coordinate increment and value        CUNIT2  = 'deg     '           / Units of coordinate increment and value        CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'           / TAN (gnomonic) projection + SIP distortions    CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'           / TAN (gnomonic) projection + SIP distortions    CRVAL1  = '' / [deg] Coordinate value at reference point                        CRVAL2  = '' / [deg] Coordinate value at reference point                        LONPOLE = '' / [deg] Native longitude of celestial pole                         LATPOLE = '' / [deg] Native latitude of celestial pole                          MJDREF  = '' / [d] MJD of fiducial time                                         RADESYS = 'ICRS    '           / Equatorial coordinate system                   EQUINOX =                 2000 / equinox of celestial coordinate system         PMRA    = '' / yr] RA proper motion                                             PMDEC   = '' / yr] Dec proper motion                                            PMTOTAL = '' / yr] total proper motion                                          VISMAG  = '' / [mag] VISDA magnitude                                            JMAG    = '' / [mag] j magnitude                                                HMAG    = '' / [mag] h magnitude                                                KMAG    = '' / [mag] k magnitude                                                